<title>MALAYSIA: Westmont Industries 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Westmont Industries 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  63.42   vs	 105.07</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 26.0    vs	  94.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   568.40   vs	 601.59</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    74.45   vs	 112.66</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs  less   2.87</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries     less 8.54   vs  less   0.1</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)	3.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Westmont Industries Bhd is involved in marine engineering activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
